{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23254","headline":"钱湖州以箬下酒李苏州以五酘酒相次寄到无因饮聊咏所怀 · 白居易","name":"钱湖州以箬下酒李苏州以五酘酒相次寄到无因饮聊咏所怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"劳将箬下忘忧物，寄与江城爱酒翁。\n铛脚三州何处会，瓮头一醆几时同。\n倾如竹叶盈樽绿，饮作桃花上面红。\n莫怪殷勤醉相忆，曾陪西省与南宫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23254.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23254","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}